When all of the above is done, we wanna take a step back and employ more agents, specialized at each task and improve upon the code. Boot time, minimize the code needed, general improvments to make it better, faster more secure. Less code, less attack surface. And since the keyboard wont work without this hub, boot speed if of the essence. We can never be on par with the SEEED XIAO, but as close as possible. Use tricks to start as fast as possible, with bluetooth. Spotify etc can have some sort of delayed start/background start. As that wont be noticed in the extra 30 secs it takes or whatever.
